+- obligation count `0`
+- target `null`
+- designated sorry count `0`
+- trust declaration count `41`
+- `lake clean`: exit `0`, empty-output SHA-256
+  `e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855`
+- `lake build`: exit `0`, output SHA-256
